{"id":"n14013-1-9","stage":1,"title":"연락 · 联络","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14013-1-9-1","ko":"너 선생님께 급히 오라는 연락 받았니?","zh":"你收到老师让你赶紧过去的消息了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님께","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님께","audio":"/audio/bcdd3ceebd3e89795264.mp3"}},{"text":"급히","meaning":"急速地，迅速地","explanation":"급히：急速地，迅速地。","readings":[{"term":"급히","audio":"/audio/63da876fcdd39cb64834.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37217","senseId":"2","lemma":"급히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급히","audio":"/audio/63da876fcdd39cb64834.mp3"}},{"text":"오라는","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오라는","audio":"/audio/0c893c6bf409761a7364.mp3"}},{"text":"연락","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}},{"text":"받았니?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다